"Verification — individual identity requests, with the evidence members uploaded. Institutions — schools and universities, including the email domains that then auto-verify their students. Association Review — every country’s business verification queue, how long each business has waited, and which business association covers that country. Employers — employer accounts and their recruiters.\n"
